# ===========================================
# SOLANA FEE SPONSORSHIP (Required for send-payment claim)
# ===========================================
# Base58 private key (or JSON array [1,2,...,64]) of a wallet funded with SOL.
# Used as fee payer for:
#   - Send-payment CLAIM: creating the recipient's USDC token account + gas (required if recipient has no ATA).
#   - Send-payment RECLAIM: gas when sender takes funds back.
#   - "Pay privately" with Loofta balance (user needs no SOL).
# Without this, recipients get "Cannot create recipient token account; sponsorship not configured".
# Fund this wallet with a small amount of SOL (e.g. 0.1 SOL on mainnet).
# Note: Privy gas sponsorship (dashboard) applies to user-signed txs; claim is server-sent, so backend needs this key.
# SOLANA_FEE_PAYER_PRIVATE_KEY=your-base58-private-key
# SOLANA_RPC_URL=https://mainnet.helius-rpc.com/?api-key=...
# HELIUS_API_KEY=your-helius-key

# ===========================================
# SEND PAYMENT & PRIVATE PAYMENTS
# ===========================================
# Required for send payment links (create/claim). 32-byte hex key.
# SEND_PAYMENT_ENC_KEY=your-32-byte-hex-key

# Optional: Privacy Cash relayer (default https://api3.privacycash.org)
# NEXT_PUBLIC_RELAYER_API_URL=https://api3.privacycash.org

# Required for "Pay privately": path to ZK circuit files (base path without .wasm/.zkey).
# The privacycash npm package does not ship circuit2/. Get transaction2.wasm and transaction2.zkey
# from the Privacy Cash SDK repo (e.g. https://github.com/Privacy-Cash/privacy-cash-sdk or ask the team),
# place them in a directory and set this to the full path to the base (e.g. /path/to/circuit2/transaction2).
# PRIVACYCASH_CIRCUIT_BASE_PATH=/path/to/circuit2/transaction2

# ===========================================
# APP CONFIG
# ===========================================
PORT=4000
NODE_ENV=development
